&lt;h3 id=&quot;A-bit-more-realistic-approach&quot;&gt;A bit more realistic approach&lt;a class=&quot;anchor-link&quot; href=&quot;#A-bit-more-realistic-approach&quot;&gt; &lt;&#x2F;a&gt;&lt;&#x2F;h3&gt;
